  "text": "BluePearl Pet Hospital | Southfield, MI\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Southfield, MI\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nSouthfield, MI\n24/7 Emergency and Specialty\n248.354.6640\n29080 Inkster Rd.\nSouthfield, MI 48034\n[email protected]\nEmergency:\n24/7\nSpecialty:\nBy appointment\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nBluePearl Pet Hospital – serving Southfield.\nWe are located in Southfield, north of downtown Detroit. Along with our sister pet hospital in Auburn Hills, we serve the northern suburbs of Detroit.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nWhen your pet needs emergency care, seconds count. Our team is ready to provide expert care in case of a pet emergency. If your pet requires a veterinary specialist, we are ready for that too. Our experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nEmergency\nIn an emergency, call ahead to your BluePearl vet and let us know you’re coming. No appointment is necessary for our emergency vet.\nLearn more about your emergency visit.\nSpecialty care\nOur veterinary specialists work directly with your primary care vet to understand your pet’s condition and develop the appropriate treatment plan. Visits to our specialists are usually by referral from your primary care vet and by appointment.\nLearn more about veterinary specialists.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Pet Hospital Southfield.\nOur BluePearl pet hospital on Inkster Road in Southfield gathers an uncommonly large array of specialists and emergency vets who team up to meet any demand.\nWe are the largest group of board-certified veterinary specialists in southeastern Michigan and have a fully-equipped 38,000 square-foot specialty and emergency pet hospital with the capacity to care for 40 to 50 patients at a time.\nOur experts provide the best in diagnostic and therapeutic services. An MRI and CT scanner set Southfield apart from many practices. We offer radioiodine I-131 treatment for cats with hyperthyroidism and have the ability to provide hemodialysis to patients with specific types of kidney disease.\nFounded in 1990 as Michigan Veterinary Specialists, we were the first private practice multi-specialty hospital in the state and continue to combine cutting-edge technology with compassionate care.\nPet owners.\nAt BluePearl Pet Hospitals, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n248.354.6640\nor\n[email protected]\n.\nTestimonials.\n“I can never thank the staff and vets enough for taking such good care of not only Navarre but me too.” — Nicole\nRead more of\nNicole’s story\n.\nIn a trying time, they never failed to go above and beyond what was expected to make Bing and our family feel so comfortable. Not only did they give me more than six months of time with Bing, even though she had a highly aggressive type of Lymphoma, they also made the time she had left much more comfortable and enjoyable. — Will\nRead more about\nWill’s experience with the oncology team\nat BluePearl Southfield.\nCurrent location.\n248.354.6640\n248.354.0303\n29080 Inkster Rd.\nSouthfield,\nMI                                    48034\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Neurology\nFarmington, MI\n33300 W 9 Mile Rd.\nFarmington, MI 48336\n248.516.1122\n4.31 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nAuburn Hills, MI\n3412 E Walton Blvd.\nAuburn Hills, MI 48326\n248.371.3713\n13.09 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nAnn Arbor, MI\n4126 Packard Rd.\nAnn Arbor, MI 48108\n734.971.8774\n26.84 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
